exports[`canonical-agent seed prompts > K2 Agent role positional message 1`] = `"Run the K2 Agent skill for the workspace "AcmeWorkspace". First read .k2so/agent/AGENT.md, then weave the K2 Agent role guidance into it organically — preserving everything the user already wrote. Show me the merged result before the core persists it."`;

exports[`canonical-agent seed prompts > K2 Agent role system prompt 1`] = `
"Run the K2 Agent skill. READ the existing AGENT.md, weave the role guidance in organically with judgment, PRESERVE existing context, NEVER inject a templated block. The deterministic core backs up AGENT.md and writes your merged text atomically.

The K2 Agent role knowledge lives in the skill under .k2so/skills/k2-agent/SKILL.md — load it, then integrate it into the user's AGENT.md (.k2so/agent/AGENT.md) without displacing the accumulated context the agent already relies on. If a section already covers the role, refine it in place rather than appending a duplicate block."
`;

